# Adobe After Effects MCP — Cursor Rules

## Identity
This project is a self-contained MCP server for Adobe After Effects automation.
It works with any AI agent. Cursor connects via `.cursor/mcp.json` automatically.

## Always-on Rules
- Never auto-launch After Effects. Ask the user to open it first.
- Never create residual log files (CHANGELOG.md, live_error_log.md, etc.).
- Never reference or use Google Cloud / BigQuery / `datacloud_*` tools.
- MCP config lives only inside this project — do not write to global Cursor settings.
- Report results directly in chat after `npm run build` + `node test/verify-build.js` pass 100%.

## Dual-Audit V2 (required before reporting done)
1. `npm run build` — tsc must pass with 0 errors
2. `node test/verify-build.js` — all 4 checks must PASS (167 tools, 13 skills, ae://rules/*, no GEMINI.md)

